00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.650
Now... Who doesn't know
how traffic lights work?!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.690
That's me, hop!

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.440
You no longer have to worry!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:26.030
I, Right-Left Man, will teach you well!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:30.870
The way Right-Left Man comes
close is something else, hop.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:32.160
First, green!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.330
It's a signal that means you can go,

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.830
but you can't let your
guard down these days!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.800
Someone could outrageously
run into you out of nowhere.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:44.220
Make sure you check
right and left carefully!

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:48.260
There are definitely some people
who drive dangerously in their lives,

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:52.350
but trying to correct them
only causes you injuries!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.690
So, make sure you use your goodwill
and kindness only on those

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:59.900
who are able to receive them!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.650
Next is yellow!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:05.820
When the green light starts blinking,
it means "stop," just like yellow!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.910
"Proceed with caution" is wrong, okay?!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:12.620
Every year, you'll feel that the year
went by quicker than the previous year.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:16.410
So, we all tend to hurry
things up every day.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:20.630
But there are times when you
definitely have to stop or go back.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.760
In those times, trying to proceed
by pushing yourself definitely won't

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:28.680
get you more ahead when you
look at it in the long term, okay?!

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:33.520
The last one is red!
This means "stop no matter what"!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:37.890
The wrong, split-second decision
can cause an irreversible situation.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.690
So, make sure that you stay alert and
pay attention to the red light, okay?!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:46.570
Even if people around you all start
walking together on a red light,

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.240
make sure you stop with
strong determination, okay?!

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.240
I don't want you to be swayed by
biased ideas just because they're loud

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:56.910
and get swallowed by a puppet
that's given up on thinking.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.790
This is it from me, Right-Left Man!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:04.840
I'm praying that the paths you kids
take will have no accidents!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.970
Right-Left Man! Thank you, hop!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:15.310
Maybe because of his costume, I can't
pay attention to what he's saying at all.

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.310
Uramichi Oniisan!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.810
I've got a delivery for you!

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.310
"MHK Enterprise"
"Keep Dry"

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.470
E-Excuse me...

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.680
Uramichi Oniisan!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:57.060
Did you receive the
Right-Left Man PVC figures?

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.350
It's really popular...

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.270
...although I don't get why.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.980
Ah... I see.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.440
But... um...

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.610
I don't need this many, so I brought
them back to return them.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.400
I live alone, so...

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.450
What?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.660
Oh, that's right. I also have some
extras of a different version sample,

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:18.160
so I'll give them to you, too.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.710
It's a PVC figure of God of Shiso.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:27.800
I wish we could've made its face look
a little more like God of Shiso,

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:32.260
but we came to the conclusion in
the meeting that children probably

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.390
wouldn't be interested
in your face or looking at it.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.810
Do you have fun making things like this?

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:45.150
Do fun jobs really exist?

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:46.980
Well...

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.190
Did you have a dream?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.110
"Squeak"

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.560
"Squeeeak"

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.240
Dream?

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.530
I used to play music in a band.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.660
One day, one of the members started saying

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.040
that he was tired of pursuing
our dream, so we split up.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.250
But then, when watching TV, I found out
that he became a comedian and was in

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.500
a weird segment shot
on location late at night.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.760
Around that time, my ex, whom I had
been dating for four or five years,

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:17.100
was saying that she'd stay single for the
rest of her life and that she hated kids.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:18.810
But then, a little while
after we broke up,

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:23.350
she was letting people know that she got
married and had a child on F**ebook.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.860
She told me that she didn't wanna
see me ever again when we broke up,

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.280
and yet, as soon as she
found out that I joined MHK,

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.690
"May 15" "It's been a while!
Is it true that you joined MHK?"

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:35.850
she wanted me to get her kid in the
studio shoot of <i>Together with Maman</i>.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.940
"I have a favor to ask"

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:40.490
I can't say that my current life
is more fulfilling than before,

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.080
but I at least feel somewhat at ease.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:49.590
So, I've come to realize that it was me
who was tired of pursuing the dream.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:51.130
Kikaku-<i>san</i>...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.840
Doors of sympathy

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.840
Creak

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.840
Sorry. I said too much.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:11:00.890
The shoot is about to start,
right? Good luck.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.180
Kikaku-<i>san</i>...

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.980
Doors of sympathy

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.980
Shut

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.530
Uramichi Oniisan!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.650
Hello, kids!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.360
"Together with Maman"

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.320
How are you?!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.570
I'm Uramichi--

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.830
Hey, look!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:28.120
This is Right-Left Man!
My mom bought it for me! Lucky me!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.460
Yeah!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.960
That's amazing! It looks cool!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:35.130
Well, I don't really think
it's cool or anything.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.510
But do you think he really
looks like Right-Left Man?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.600
What?

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.100
For example, his face?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:55.360
We don't think too much
about his face, right?

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.410
Yeah. Right-Left Man is a concept, so...

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:02.580
I've never paid attention
to his face in the first place.

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.120
I see.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.870
Uramichi Oniisan!

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:10.040
Okay, kids!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.460
Today's topic is "When we grow up"!

